WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:02.377
My idea of success is not money.

00:00:02.919 --> 00:00:04.440
It's not, you know, 

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:05.630
it's not getting a lot of money.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:08.550
I think if that's your idea of 
success, then that's great.

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:12.960
But it's um, I think it's not 
really why we're here.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:14.139
I think we're here to communicate

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:17.787
and to share ideas and stuff,
and I think that is successful.

00:00:17.787 --> 00:00:20.935
Back home in New Zealand,
we have this saying, tēnā koe.

00:00:20.935 --> 00:00:22.498
That's a Māori saying. Tēnā koe.

00:00:22.498 --> 00:00:23.815
That's how you say hello.

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:26.276
And what it literally means 
is "there you are".

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:28.778
If you're saying it to a group of 
people, tēnā koutou.

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:29.716
"There you guys are".

00:00:29.716 --> 00:00:33.366
So the fact that we're here,
that we're even on Earth

00:00:33.366 --> 00:00:36.453
in the first place, I think 
that's success in itself.

00:00:36.786 --> 00:00:39.831
So, congratulations
everyone on being here.

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:43.334
And I wish you all the
best in your creative lives.

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:46.379
And on that note, cheers.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:49.007
Kia ora, kia ora, kia ora.

